-- Two mixfix operators sharing the head keyword `the will`, distinguishable
-- only by their LATER keywords. `l4 batch` re-prints this module through
-- `prettyLayout` and re-runs it once per input row, so if the printer drops
-- the interior keywords the two calls below collapse into the same text and
-- the rule becomes `P AND NOT P` (smucclaw/l4-ide#967).
GIVEN w IS A NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the will` w `is duly executed without` n MEANS w GREATER THAN n

GIVEN w IS A NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the will` w `is revoked counting` n MEANS w LESS THAN n

@export
GIVEN w IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `gift stands` w IS
  (`the will` w `is duly executed without` 3) AND NOT (`the will` w `is revoked counting` 3)
